---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Us — Zen Aesthetic Clock">
  <!-- Dynamic Blobs Background -->
  <div class="fixed inset-0 z-[-2] bg-canvas overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center transition-colors duration-1000" id="bg-container">
    <div class="absolute w-[60vw] h-[60vw] max-w-[800px] max-h-[800px] bg-[#00ffff] opacity-30 dark:opacity-20 rounded-full blur-[100px] animate-blob-1" id="blob1"></div>
    <div class="absolute w-[50vw] h-[50vw] max-w-[700px] max-h-[700px] bg-[#ff00ff] opacity-30 dark:opacity-20 rounded-full blur-[100px] animate-blob-2" id="blob2"></div>
    <div class="absolute w-[55vw] h-[55vw] max-w-[750px] max-h-[750px] bg-[#ffff00] opacity-30 dark:opacity-20 rounded-full blur-[100px] animate-blob-3" id="blob3"></div>
  </div>

  <!-- Header Navigation -->
  <header class="w-full max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-6 flex items-center justify-between z-10 relative">
    <a href="/" class="flex items-center space-x-2 text-ink font-semibold tracking-tight text-sm hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity">
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg>
      <span>Zen Aesthetic Clock</span>
    </a>
    <nav class="flex items-center space-x-4">
      <a href="/about/" data-astro-prefetch class="text-sm text-ink font-bold transition-colors">About</a>
      <a href="/contact/" data-astro-prefetch class="text-sm text-body hover:text-ink font-semibold transition-colors">Contact</a>
      <a href="/privacy/" data-astro-prefetch class="text-sm text-body hover:text-ink font-semibold transition-colors">Privacy</a>
      <a href="/terms/" data-astro-prefetch class="text-sm text-body hover:text-ink font-semibold transition-colors">Terms</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <!-- Main Content Area -->
  <main class="flex-1 w-full max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 z-10 relative">
    <!-- Back Button -->
    <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center space-x-2 text-xs text-mute hover:text-ink transition-colors mb-8 group">
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="transform group-hover:-translate-x-0.5 transition-transform"><line x1="19" y1="12" x2="5" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 19 5 12 12 5"/></svg>
      <span>Back to Clock</span>
    </a>

    <!-- Glassmorphic Content Card -->
    <article class="bg-canvas-soft/80 backdrop-blur-md border border-hairline rounded-lg p-8 md:p-12 shadow-lg select-text">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-ink tracking-tight mb-8">About Us</h1>
      
      <div class="prose prose-sm dark:prose-invert max-w-none space-y-6 text-sm text-body leading-relaxed">
        <p class="text-base font-medium text-ink">
          Zen Aesthetic Clock was born out of a simple idea: that utility tools can be beautiful, and focus tools should feel calm.
        </p>
        <p>
          In a world dominated by hyper-stimulating websites and distracting alerts, finding the right zone for deep work is incredibly difficult. Many clocks and focus timers are cluttered, poorly designed, or covered in intrusive pop-ups. We wanted to design the exact opposite—a digital companion that flows into the background of your workspace, enhances your desk aesthetic, and supports your concentration.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink mt-8">Our Core Principles</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mt-4">
          <div class="bg-canvas p-4 rounded border border-hairline shadow-sm">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-ink text-sm mb-2">Visual Quietness</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-mute leading-relaxed">We practice extreme minimalism. No clutter, no pop-up alerts, and soft dynamic backgrounds that relax the eyes.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-canvas p-4 rounded border border-hairline shadow-sm">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-ink text-sm mb-2">Premium Utility</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-mute leading-relaxed">High-fidelity typography, customizable time configurations, and responsive designs that scale across desktops, iPads, and mobile screens.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-canvas p-4 rounded border border-hairline shadow-sm">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-ink text-sm mb-2">User Ownership</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-mute leading-relaxed">All settings, layouts, and custom playlist keys are saved entirely in your local browser. We never track or upload your preferences.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink mt-8">Core Features</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 ml-4">
          <li><strong>Digital Clock & Custom Pomodoro:</strong> Toggle between a sleek timekeeper with seconds and an custom focus interval countdown.</li>
          <li><strong>Lofi Focus Player:</strong> Paste any YouTube video or livestream link to play background ambient focus tracks without leaving the site. The application automatically remembers your last-entered video link so it instantly reloads on your next visit.</li>
          <li><strong>Cinematic Zen Mode:</strong> Double-tap to clear the screen, scale up the clock display, and dim the background, turning your display into a gorgeous desk screensaver.</li>
          <li><strong>Hybrid Ads Model:</strong> Ad revenue keeps the clock online and free to use, but entering Zen Mode instantly unmounts ads to ensure zero distractions during study blocks.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink mt-8">The Team</h2>
        <p>
          We are a small team of independent designers and developers passionate about productivity and interface aesthetics. We built this app to solve our own desk setups and are excited to share it with developers, students, writers, and digital workers around the world.
        </p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>

  <!-- Footer Navigation -->
  <footer class="w-full max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-8 border-t border-hairline text-center text-xs text-mute z-10 relative">
    <div class="flex justify-center space-x-6 mb-4">
      <a href="/about/" data-astro-prefetch class="text-ink font-semibold transition-colors">About Us</a>
      <a href="/contact/" data-astro-prefetch class="hover:text-ink transition-colors">Contact Us</a>
      <a href="/privacy/" data-astro-prefetch class="hover:text-ink transition-colors">Privacy Policy</a>
      <a href="/terms/" data-astro-prefetch class="hover:text-ink transition-colors">Terms & Conditions</a>
    </div>
    <p>&copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} Zen Aesthetic Clock. All rights reserved.</p>
  </footer>

  <script>
    // Randomize background blob starting positions on load
    const blobs = [document.getElementById('blob1'), document.getElementById('blob2'), document.getElementById('blob3')];
    const animationDurations = [25, 30, 35];
    blobs.forEach((blob, index) => {
      if (blob) {
        const duration = animationDurations[index];
        const randomDelay = Math.random() * -duration;
        blob.style.animationDelay = `${randomDelay}s`;
      }
    });
  </script>
</Layout>
